※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-24T07:58:17" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BUSINESSMAN
サラリーマン</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
