				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
・はい＋ジオネット登録済み→msg_geonet_03
　はい＋ジオネット未登録→msg_geonet_04
　いいえ→msg_geonet_05</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</CommentCell>
